  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TASO/TEACH II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TASO/TEACH II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TASO is Uganda&apos;s oldest and largest AIDS organization. It has developed models of excellence in providing HIV prevention, care and support to communities. The TEACH (TASO Experiential Attachment to Combat HIV/AIDS) programme provides short-term training placements for trainees in the SSA region. Under this phase II support 540 placements will be sponsored.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TASO &#xE4;r Ugandas &#xE4;ldsta och st&#xF6;rsta aidsorganisation. Organisationen har utvecklat idealmodeller f&#xF6;r prevention av hiv, f&#xF6;r v&#xE5;rd och f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d till gr&#xE4;srotsniv&#xE5;n. TEACH (TASO Experiential Attachment to Combat HIV/AIDS) programmet tillhandah&#xE5;ller korttidsplaceringar i utbildningssyfte I Afrika s&#xF6;der om Sahara. I den h&#xE4;r fasen, fas II kommer st&#xF6;d ges till 540 placeringar.</narrative>
  </description>
